      "sourceTextSha256": "3bd159bf9b95cf70cdc5921d79fdb89379b1095383fddbf80ed2ee6fc2cc8427",
      "text": "Enjoy a free day in the vibrant city of Rio de Janeiro at your own pace. Whether you choose to relax on the famous beaches of Copacabana and Ipanema, explore the colorful streets of Santa Teresa, visit local markets, or discover hidden gems around the city, this day is yours to enjoy however you like. Take in the lively atmosphere, taste authentic Brazilian cuisine, or simply soak up the breathtaking views and tropical vibes of Rio. Your guide will be available for recommendations, but the day is completely free for personal exploration and relaxation.",
